{"metadata":{"title":"Known issues and how to debug SPM targets","modules":[{"name":"AdaEngine"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Xcode Instruments: “Required kernel recording resources are in use by another document”","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Xcode-Instruments-Required-kernel-recording-resources-are-in-use-by-another-document"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When profiling an SPM project (without an xcodeproj) in Instruments, you may see a message about kernel recording resources being in use, even when no other Instruments documents are open.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cause:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" The message is misleading. The real cause is that the binary does not have the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"get-task-allow"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement. SPM does not distinguish between “release” and “profiling,” so profiling uses a release build without this entitlement."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Solution:"}]},{"text":" Re-sign the binary with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"get-task-allow"},{"text":" entitlement before launching Instruments.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Open your scheme (Cmd-Shift-,).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Profile → Pre-actions"}]},{"text":", add a Pre-action.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set the shell to ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/bin\/zsh","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Paste the re-sign script below (the ","type":"text"},{"code":"=(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" syntax is zsh process substitution):"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"code":["# For Instruments, re-sign binary with get-task-allow entitlement","codesign -s - -v -f --entitlements =(echo -n '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>","<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-\/\/Apple\/\/DTD PLIST 1.0\/\/EN\" \"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/DTDs\/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">","<plist version=\"1.0\">","    <dict>","        <key>com.apple.security.get-task-allow<\/key>","        <true\/>","    <\/dict>","<\/plist>') ${TARGET_BUILD_DIR}\/${PRODUCT_NAME}"],"syntax":"zsh","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See also: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cocoaphony.micro.blog\/2022\/10\/29\/solving-required-kernel.html","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (Rob Napier).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The script is stored in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".swiftpm\/xcode\/xcshareddata\/xcschemes\/<schemename>.xcscheme"},{"text":". The pre-action runs only for Profile, so it does not affect normal builds.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note:","type":"text"}]},{"text":" Pre-action scripts do not receive ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SRCROOT"},{"text":"; if the script fails, Xcode will not show details—check Console.app for logs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adaengine\/spmdebug"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/documentation\/AdaEngine"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/documentation\/AdaEngine\/SPMDebug"},"references":{"doc://AdaEngine/documentation/AdaEngine":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/documentation\/AdaEngine","role":"collection","title":"AdaEngine","url":"\/documentation\/adaengine","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Bringing simple and powerful game engine for your awesome games.","type":"text"}]},"https://cocoaphony.micro.blog/2022/10/29/solving-required-kernel.html":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Solving “Required kernel recording resources…” in Instruments"}],"url":"https:\/\/cocoaphony.micro.blog\/2022\/10\/29\/solving-required-kernel.html","title":"Solving “Required kernel recording resources…” in Instruments","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/cocoaphony.micro.blog\/2022\/10\/29\/solving-required-kernel.html"}}}